&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Skeletons, lasers, tattoo buses — the Torq brand grabs attention like nothing else in cybersecurity. And we&#39;re growing like crazy, backed by Series D funding, 200% employee growth, and 300% revenue growth. Fueling Torq&#39;s momentum is our game-changing AI SOC platform, backed by a team and culture that makes Torq one of Forbes&#39; Best Startup Employers in America, and a Business Insider &#39;startup to bet your career on&#39;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Life at Torq is all gas, no brakes. We&#39;re a team of relentless, collaborative go-getters pushing the boundaries of what&#39;s possible for security automation. Every role is an essential driver of Torq&#39;s success as the AI-native autonomous SecOps platform of choice for security teams across the Fortune 500.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;308&quot; data-end=&quot;629&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced and motivated &lt;strong data-start=&quot;356&quot; data-end=&quot;382&quot;&gt;Regional Sales Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our growing EMEA Sales organization. Based in the London area, you will be responsible for driving new business across the UK market, partnering with enterprise customers to transform their Security Operations with Torq&#39;s AI SOC platform.&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll own the full sales cycle, build strategic account plans, develop lasting customer relationships, and work closely with Sales Engineers, Customer Success, Marketing, and Channel teams to accelerate growth.&lt;br&gt;This is a remote position based in the London.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;2kkh5z&quot; data-start=&quot;910&quot; data-end=&quot;933&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;935&quot; data-end=&quot;1635&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;122dith&quot; data-start=&quot;935&quot; data-end=&quot;1066&quot;&gt;Sell Torq&#39;s AI SOC platform, transforming Security Operations from alert triage through autonomous investigation and remediation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16vzu79&quot; data-start=&quot;1067&quot; data-end=&quot;1120&quot;&gt;Own the full sales cycle from prospecting to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1w6o2ws&quot; data-start=&quot;1121&quot; data-end=&quot;1192&quot;&gt;Consistently achieve and exceed quarterly and annual revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19j07ri&quot; data-start=&quot;1193&quot; data-end=&quot;1251&quot;&gt;Build and execute strategic territory and account plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bzq5hf&quot; data-start=&quot;1252&quot; data-end=&quot;1344&quot;&gt;Develop trusted relationships with enterprise customers, executives, and channel partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1369mge&quot; data-start=&quot;1345&quot; data-end=&quot;1437&quot;&gt;Drive complex, multi-stakeholder sales opportunities across technical and business buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rao872&quot; data-start=&quot;1438&quot; data-end=&quot;1556&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Sales Engineers, Customer Success, Marketing, and Channel teams to win strategic opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18jkz2g&quot; data-start=&quot;1557&quot; data-end=&quot;1635&quot;&gt;Accurately manage pipeline, forecasting, and account activity in Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
