&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1664&quot; data-end=&quot;2271&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5rtcmp&quot; data-start=&quot;1664&quot; data-end=&quot;1720&quot;&gt;3+ years of Enterprise cybersecurity sales experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1889sub&quot; data-start=&quot;1721&quot; data-end=&quot;1800&quot;&gt;Proven track record of consistently exceeding quota and winning new business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1suulzu&quot; data-start=&quot;1801&quot; data-end=&quot;1884&quot;&gt;Experience selling complex cybersecurity platforms into enterprise organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ez6fi9&quot; data-start=&quot;1885&quot; data-end=&quot;1959&quot;&gt;Strong executive presence with experience engaging C-level stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13cw8i6&quot; data-start=&quot;1960&quot; data-end=&quot;2032&quot;&gt;Experience with solution selling and consultative sales methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bvs1lo&quot; data-start=&quot;2033&quot; data-end=&quot;2124&quot;&gt;Familiarity with sales frameworks such as MEDDICC, Challenger, or Command of the Message.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;s6usts&quot; data-start=&quot;2125&quot; data-end=&quot;2197&quot;&gt;Self-starter with a hunter mentality who enjoys building new business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;p1m8n9&quot; data-start=&quot;2198&quot; data-end=&quot;2271&quot;&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-growing, high-velocity startup environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;17hey2t&quot; data-start=&quot;2273&quot; data-end=&quot;2288&quot;&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h2&gt;
