&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;co23z5&quot; data-start=&quot;2290&quot; data-end=&quot;2373&quot;&gt;Experience selling AI, SecOps, SOAR, SIEM, XDR, or security operations platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
